cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the companion paper."
title: "Interface Diagnostic: reference implementation for linear-readout floors and threshold recovery"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the Interface Diagnostic and of the eight experimental campaigns
  reported in the companion paper, together with the manuscript sources, raw results, run records
  and the weights of every network the campaigns produce. Campaigns E1-E6 are CPU-only; E7 and E8 need an
  accelerator to train, but every number the paper draws from them is recomputed from the committed
  weights by a CPU-only analysis step.
